TASK: Generate a report for my 'City Auto Group' organization that calculates inventory_turnover, lead_conversion_rates, and gross_profit_estimates per dealership and per model for the date range '2024-07-01' to '2024-12-31', and return the results sorted by highest gross_profit_estimates first.
